  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Whispers say Slick Sammy arose from the rotted underbelly of Subchain City, a ghost in the grease. Some claim he was once a gilded beak, a ledger lord who lost everything in the great DRIP drought, now forever haunted by the past.",
